{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/41445556?","display_login":"saikiran2001","gravatar_id":"","id":"41445556","login":"saikiran2001","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/saikiran2001"},"created_at":"2021-01-02T16:37:43Z","id":"14690747800","org":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/68725628?","gravatar_id":"","id":"68725628","login":"Project-Awaken","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/orgs\\/Project-Awaken"},"payload":{"before":"01b3b4dcd961a4515a337403510233fbfdc880d7","commits":[{"author":{"email":"c99509495b0ae538e72da0d0e92cd7afd4da25f1@codeaurora.org","name":"Zhou Song"},"distinct":true,"message":"hal: reset swb path during ssr offline\\n\\nDuring ssr offline, the swb path needs to be reset,\\nthen ssr online is received, the path can be enabled\\nagain.\\n\\nChange-Id: Ib97a3ece2ba08ce8701ef369eafdb415e4f63cfd","sha":"4f43e35531ac7a9bb0c7b5f96797f3ae05748ab9","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/4f43e35531ac7a9bb0c7b5f96797f3ae05748ab9"},{"author":{"email":"4d768f0be2a8cc8b2c41c92b8d776eb94b61d875@codeaurora.org","name":"Lakshman Chaluvaraju"},"distinct":true,"message":"configs: sdm710: Add acdb id for UNPROCESSED USB HEADSET MIC.\\n\\nAudioFrequencyUnprocessed, Cts test case fails.\\nIt picks default acdb id 44 instead of 133 for unprocessed\\nsource.\\n\\nAdd acdb id 133 for UNPROCESSED_USB_HEADSET_MIC.\\n\\nCRs-Fixed: 2467821\\nChange-Id: I49fb83db7639486c4edc1961c99ce87abe17d700","sha":"439915ac0ce9be3e55ff0e3e8074ef7a3ac84892","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/439915ac0ce9be3e55ff0e3e8074ef7a3ac84892"},{"author":{"email":"6fbec8cc62c8a714976289b91eea0ddbacdf6495@codeaurora.org","name":"Vignesh Kulothungan"},"distinct":true,"message":"hal: enable haptic usecase to send app type cfg\\n\\nHaptic usecase was not included to send app type config to driver.\\nDuring session open driver sets incorrect rtac audio calibration\\ninformation and so during real time calibration the tool displays\\nno COPP information. So include haptic usecase to send app type\\nconfiguration.\\n\\nCRs-Fixed: 2488580\\nChange-Id: Iae4c4442cd9312a1271876e663fe14ead4c36c54","sha":"0a2eff0411978c293d0887b6416dcfaf1b5ae37c","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/0a2eff0411978c293d0887b6416dcfaf1b5ae37c"},{"author":{"email":"79421c810df64f2f8ef51a9d7731d82b9577cb39@codeaurora.org","name":"Manisha Agarwal"},"distinct":true,"message":"Configs: lito: Changes for concurrent record usecase.\\n\\nAdd separate backend for headset-mic for\\nconcurrent record usecase.\\n\\nDisable dedicated headset path for sva.\\nHeadset mic path conflicts between audio recording and sva.\\n\\nSet the max count to 2 to allow concurrent capture\\nuse cases to be started.\\n\\nChange-Id: I187c9217066968debd6d458961f658f3ef0cecc8","sha":"547acfd1e7984afd455b8b9d6801ab2e78bb5f74","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/547acfd1e7984afd455b8b9d6801ab2e78bb5f74"},{"author":{"email":"5549e2952d3f6a7bfd7813a6354235c3c9d1d3f2@codeaurora.org","name":"Revathi Uddaraju"},"distinct":true,"message":"config: enable Audio HIDL HAL 5.0\\n\\nenable Audio HIDL HAL 5.0 for trinket, lito and atoll and QSSI.\\n\\nChange-Id: I24d45d56c9b79e3f397f7e892e46a1b7d2e570fc","sha":"b7cb9ff611bbf8b4e21a6fb8e0be361f478c445e","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/b7cb9ff611bbf8b4e21a6fb8e0be361f478c445e"},{"author":{"email":"c76ad1a5417d5e5ec6068289c7ca2032944e4216@google.com","name":"Phil Burk"},"distinct":true,"message":"audio_hw: close mmap file descriptor to fix leak\\n\\nThe file descriptor for MMAP shared memory was created\\nand passed to AudioFlinger but never closed.\\nNow FD is closed when the stream is goes to standby.\\n\\nBug: 134381208\\nTest: Get HAL pid.\\nTest:     adb shell ps | grep audio\\nTest:     adb shell ls -l \\/proc\\/{halpid}\\/fd | wc\\nTest: Run Oboetester or other app that uses MMAP\\nTest: Completely close the app.\\nTest:     adb shell ls -l \\/proc\\/{halpid}\\/fd | wc\\nTest: Count should NOT grow each time.\\nChange-Id: Ieaaf1c6bdc96e7ecf01cee23215fb39f79662111\\n(cherry picked from commit 2e27354fd3c5adec2524813d7c34114922d3e8f4)","sha":"d898ba65d2a28da650f9eaa2760c7fc500add023","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/d898ba65d2a28da650f9eaa2760c7fc500add023"},{"author":{"email":"c99509495b0ae538e72da0d0e92cd7afd4da25f1@codeaurora.org","name":"Zhou Song"},"distinct":true,"message":"hal: remove output device force switch from bt sco to handset\\n\\nTrailing sound may leak to handset after doing force switch\\nfrom bt sco output device.\\nSince when a2dp device is selected, all active output streams\\nwill also route to a2dp during check_usecases_codec_backend,\\nthen a2dp and bt sco won\'t be active concurrently. But sco\\ninput device can be concurrent with a2dp device, so only\\ncheck force switch of input device when SCO is off.\\n\\nChange-Id: I8225859dc9a3da987ace6cee3225c375785d3bea","sha":"cb3351c9a266a1cced393abe5aa64e7cdc16a7fb","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/cb3351c9a266a1cced393abe5aa64e7cdc16a7fb"},{"author":{"email":"4a357ce398515e00e9246c212fbfb39906231174@codeaurora.org","name":"Quinn Male"},"distinct":true,"message":"hal: Fix audio_event_type_t enum ordering\\n\\nAUDIO_EVENT_SCREEN_STATUS_CHANGED was added in a previous change\\nin the middle of the enum which led to erroneous logs. This change\\nresolved that by moving it to the end of the enum.\\n\\nChange-Id: Ic01e8daaf037556886fbd5bc35491c034385a473","sha":"918796ed5d5b699be314ff8f993efc756001c894","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/918796ed5d5b699be314ff8f993efc756001c894"},{"author":{"email":"c99509495b0ae538e72da0d0e92cd7afd4da25f1@codeaurora.org","name":"Zhou Song"},"distinct":true,"message":"hal: don\'t report event to sthal for fm\\/speaker protection usecases\\n\\nThe capture device of fm\\/speaker protection won\'t conflict with\\nsound trigger tx device, so no need to report the event to sthal.\\n\\nChange-Id: Ie4238aa38b554d60414701f4e38df9e8163956fa","sha":"279ca30c0c6fd1b138737313d1ab5c36e68de041","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/279ca30c0c6fd1b138737313d1ab5c36e68de041"},{"author":{"email":"4d768f0be2a8cc8b2c41c92b8d776eb94b61d875@codeaurora.org","name":"Lakshman Chaluvaraju"},"distinct":true,"message":"fm: Restore fm on Speaker\\n\\nDuring fm plaback even though routing device is changed from WHP\\nto SPK on UI, fm continues to route through WHP on targets with\\nshared backend for WHP and SPK. This is due to APM unaware of\\nrouting device is change to SPK and selects WHP to play LL touch\\ntones causes all active usecase on SPK to move to WHP and fm\\nroutes through WHP.\\n\\nChange is to handle this scenario by re-routing fm on SPK once\\nstandby is received for LL touch tones.\\n\\nChange-Id: Ia503d4c134a3679fc2a51e2f9b7b8343e7b7cd1e","sha":"06677b41afc0e6ab4e490ae2cd6e8e745da9291e","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/06677b41afc0e6ab4e490ae2cd6e8e745da9291e"},{"author":{"email":"9beb860ea5385348d7bc797a99b96b73ed1a9877@codeaurora.org","name":"Srinu Jella"},"distinct":true,"message":"Bluetooth: Call pre init API unconditionally\\n\\n- Call pre init API un conditionally from Audio\\n  primary HAL as all valid checks have been\\n  already incorporated in the same API.\\n\\n- Without this, VTS issues are seen as HIDL 2.0\\n  is not registered from pre init API which is\\n  not being called from Audio HAL due to older\\n  vendor frameworks API usage.\\n\\nCRs-Fixed: 2493380\\nChange-Id: I12102426c6f280be2f2533ea7530a27f804e95b5","sha":"793f53090266863791d0f926e605f8c0018fbba4","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/793f53090266863791d0f926e605f8c0018fbba4"},{"author":{"email":"4d768f0be2a8cc8b2c41c92b8d776eb94b61d875@codeaurora.org","name":"Lakshman Chaluvaraju"},"distinct":true,"message":"configs: msm8936: Add speaker and headphones paths\\n\\nWhen notification sound is played during voice call, voice-speaker-and\\n-headphones device is selected. Usecase paths are missing for this\\ncombo in internal codec mixer paths xml files.\\n\\nAdded playback and voice use case paths for HS and SPKR combo device.\\n\\nChange-Id: I218ca7f1f81ba6fc7ec04d1b56aa239806588249","sha":"db24213a8c5ba1043c565f312c1861a1cbad943f","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/db24213a8c5ba1043c565f312c1861a1cbad943f"},{"author":{"email":"4d768f0be2a8cc8b2c41c92b8d776eb94b61d875@codeaurora.org","name":"Lakshman Chaluvaraju"},"distinct":true,"message":"configs: Enable AAC frame control for A2DP\\n\\nEnable frame size control for AAC codec used\\nfor A2DP playback.\\n\\nCRs-Fixed: 2345249\\nChange-Id: I6c7549fd9feebdf1acb5e06e2ceebbe56ba300b4","sha":"8cc416e99b7b36564b6e857b0a680de73212a152","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/8cc416e99b7b36564b6e857b0a680de73212a152"},{"author":{"email":"4a357ce398515e00e9246c212fbfb39906231174@codeaurora.org","name":"Quinn Male"},"distinct":true,"message":"configs: kona: Correct tty hco headset mic mixer controls\\n\\nTTY HCO headset mic pairs with tty hco handset for voice call,\\nuse TX_CDC_DMA_TX_3 controls for hco headset mic to fix no audio\\nissue in Tx path for voice tty use case.\\n\\nChange-Id: Ie3ccec8c3ffea496bda205c1f5d5fe9341378f62","sha":"ce39ca12cc84fc190b86fd0cffb18915f29064dc","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/ce39ca12cc84fc190b86fd0cffb18915f29064dc"},{"author":{"email":"1d684bb414a022d8a1bfc880b0df61ab60e1fc49@codeaurora.org","name":"Dhananjay Kumar"},"distinct":true,"message":"hal: fix fragment size calculation for compressed offload usecase\\n\\nCompress offload fragment size is using duration_us provided in\\noffload info even if its set to -1, leading to incorrect and smaller\\nvalue which in turns results in higher power consumption.\\nUpdate check for duration us to exclude invalid values and use it for\\ncalculating fragment size only if its within specified range.\\n\\nChange-Id: Ib134a67d95fe663f5f77f688469bee1bf0ce1708","sha":"b17e000a7bcfad0535ab8beceb3812329a440f2b","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/b17e000a7bcfad0535ab8beceb3812329a440f2b"},{"author":{"email":"83c8f902ff78166cb3114446473ba7de1fd2c317@codeaurora.org","name":"Weiyin Jiang"},"distinct":true,"message":"hal: fix media param not sent during gapless transition\\n\\nQC defined interfaces in tinycompress to handle metadata of extended\\naudio format. These interfaces aren\'t enabled in tinycompress lib.\\n\\nUse feature flag to enable these APIs for QC AHAL.\\n\\nCRs-Fixed: 2491047\\nChange-Id: I0644bd0965a3850ef4c728ca881bf81cdbd8bc53","sha":"d9b5a4ef7632ccb9c55c12c6ba1e66e8985e3300","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/d9b5a4ef7632ccb9c55c12c6ba1e66e8985e3300"},{"author":{"email":"83c8f902ff78166cb3114446473ba7de1fd2c317@codeaurora.org","name":"Weiyin Jiang"},"distinct":true,"message":"hal: add usecase type check\\n\\nAdd usecase type check to avoid stream.out being dereferenced in pcm\\ncapture case.\\n\\nCRs-Fixed: 2494182\\nChange-Id: I39ca104e8d34e76d4ff5cdb6177faddea04f6d96","sha":"0d373248a7dade9b294f8d3010649724fd26ef1f","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/0d373248a7dade9b294f8d3010649724fd26ef1f"},{"author":{"email":"a3532189eb3c05b63d5d3b79f7cf795678548075@codeaurora.org","name":"Sudheer Papothi"},"distinct":true,"message":"hal: configs: Add BCL mixer paths on Kona\\n\\nAdd BCL(Battery Current Limiter) mixer paths to support BCL feature\\non Kona.\\n\\nChange-Id: I1ac9d5b18e65cb4b3d4ca3d24db6a1327bc11777","sha":"0a004751c39e8d014b92460c0a00c6d60d0c279d","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/0a004751c39e8d014b92460c0a00c6d60d0c279d"},{"author":{"email":"760ddb66f5b410f0f9d53b1ec7bbafc38e75da0e@codeaurora.org","name":"Derek Chen"},"distinct":true,"message":"configs: remove common_au overlay config\\n\\nRemove common_au overlay configuration files\\non automotive platform.\\n\\nChange-Id: I5b1b5b5e9f90625a2eca9e3bd1ae64b4ca4525ce","sha":"a8709ac4f9262d31e819e7848c9262f5d1123e1f","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/a8709ac4f9262d31e819e7848c9262f5d1123e1f"},{"author":{"email":"83c8f902ff78166cb3114446473ba7de1fd2c317@codeaurora.org","name":"Weiyin Jiang"},"distinct":true,"message":"configs: remove AHAL settings from audio_config xml\\n\\nAHAL no longer retreives feature flags from configstore, removing these\\nsettings from xml file to avoid confusion.\\n\\nChange-Id: Ifa71388416e23acbe2265a9eedc121beabd7897f","sha":"f90529d2f98e5fe9fa5094618064893ee907bde9","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio\\/commits\\/f90529d2f98e5fe9fa5094618064893ee907bde9"}],"distinct_size":"987","head":"7258ba527bf2749cf475eac444d0524868b804f4","push_id":"6285846625","ref":"refs\\/heads\\/11-caf-sdm845","size":"987"},"public":true,"repo":{"id":"295748956","name":"Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audio","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Project-Awaken\\/android_hardware_qcom_audi