{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/74678550?","display_login":"actual-nh","gravatar_id":"","id":"74678550","login":"actual-nh","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh"},"created_at":"2021-01-02T16:37:54Z","id":"14690748457","org":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/4367009?","gravatar_id":"","id":"4367009","login":"CleverRaven","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/orgs\\/CleverRaven"},"payload":{"action":"created","comment":{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"#36976\\r\\n#42343\\r\\nOthers?","created_at":"2021-01-02T16:37:54Z","html_url":"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA\\/issues\\/43065#issuecomment-753495450","id":"753495450","issue_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA\\/issues\\/43065","node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc1MzQ5NTQ1MA==","updated_at":"2021-01-02T16:37:54Z","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA\\/issues\\/comments\\/753495450","user":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars2.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/74678550?v=4","events_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh\\/events{\\/privacy}","followers_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh\\/followers","following_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh\\/following{\\/other_user}","gists_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh\\/gists{\\/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/actual-nh","id":"74678550","login":"actual-nh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0Njc4NTUw","organizations_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh\\/orgs","received_events_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh\\/received_events","repos_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh\\/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh\\/starred{\\/owner}{\\/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh\\/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/actual-nh"}},"issue":{"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"<!-- Please follow the template below -->\\r\\n\\r\\n# Describe the bug\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<!-- A clear and concise description of what the bug is. -->\\r\\nSo you have a normal character, nothing special, just your average dude.\\r\\nHis basal metabolic rate at no activity is around 1700 kcal, give or take depending on age and height, we\'ll assume defaults: 175 \\/ 25. This is fine. It\'s about 4.25 portions of cooked meat per day.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe dude goes fishing [LIGHT_EXERCISE]\\r\\n\\r\\nHis basal rate jumps over to 3400 kcal. What the fuck? That\'s the equivalent of a decent athlete. Very active fishing indeed. Food cost goes up to 8.5 cooked meat a day or 2.125L. This is stretching it, but still possible I suppose.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe dude goes somewhere, just walking, to find some abandoned cars. [MODERATE_EXERCISE]\\r\\nThe basal rate is at 6800 kcal?!?!?!?\\r\\nYou do realize walking is like 90% of the game, right? Doesn\'t matter whether you\'re carrying a heavy hiking backpack or literally running naked btw. 17 cooked meats a day. 4.25L of meat a day. You need to drink less water than that.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe dude goes to weld some stuff off some cars. [BRISK_EXERCISE]\\r\\nThe basal rate goes up to an insane 10200 kcal. \\r\\nGuess that C2H2 torch is **really** heavy.\\r\\n\\r\\nThen, he realizes he\'s running low on fuel for his fireplace so he goes to the woods and chops some trees down. [ACTIVE_EXERCISE]\\r\\nAs well as trees, he\'s chopping fat and muscle off his body at a staggering 13600 kcal or 34 cooked meats a day. That\'s 8.5L of meat, which, mind you, is gonna take quite a bit of time to actually even consume -- the stomach is only 2.5L, meaning you need to fill your stomach to the brim at least 3 times in a single day.\\r\\n\\r\\nFinally, realizing that he will never be able to get his food needs sated, he digs a grave for himself and jumps into it [EXTRA_EXERCISE].\\r\\nBut his body annihilates itself as he\'s falling in midair, as it approaches a world-record setting basal rate of 17000 kcal. 42 cooked meats. 10.625L of one of the most nutritious foods short of literal fat.\\r\\n\\r\\nNeed I tell you how annoying this is for any player that does something more than sit at his base 24\\/7 reading books?\\r\\n\\r\\n# Steps To Reproduce\\r\\n\\r\\n<!-- Steps to reproduce the behavior:\\r\\n1. Make a player with a gun, magazine, and some ammo.\\r\\n2. Try to aim at a wall.\\r\\n3. There\'s no way to increase aim level. -->\\r\\n1. Play the game with a default character.\\r\\n2. Suffer.\\r\\n\\r\\n# Expected behavior\\r\\n\\r\\n<!-- A clear and concise description of what you expected to happen.\\r\\nIdeally also describe *why* you expect it to happen. -->\\r\\nI shouldn\'t be expected to eat 2 moose worth of food in a day just by walking.\\r\\n\\r\\n# Screenshots\\r\\n\\r\\n<!-- **If applicable**, add screenshots to help explain your problem.\\r\\n\\r\\nDo not take a screenshot of the crashing window. Please provide the crash logs in the \\"Additional context\\" -->\\r\\nN\\/A\\r\\n\\r\\n# Versions and configuration\\r\\nDoesn\'t really matter, but here you go.\\r\\n\\r\\n- OS: Windows\\r\\n    - OS Version: 10.0 1909\\r\\n- Game Version: 0.E-5221-g315a4f0 [64-bit]\\r\\n- Graphics Version: Tiles\\r\\n- Game Language: System language []\\r\\n- Mods loaded: [\\r\\n    Dark Days Ahead [dda],\\r\\n    Disable NPC Needs [no_npc_food]\\r\\n]\\r\\n# Additional context\\r\\n```c\\r\\nconstexpr float NO_EXERCISE = 1.0f;\\r\\nconstexpr float LIGHT_EXERCISE = 2.0f;\\r\\nconstexpr float MODERATE_EXERCISE = 4.0f;\\r\\nconstexpr float BRISK_EXERCISE = 6.0f;\\r\\nconstexpr float ACTIVE_EXERCISE = 8.0f;\\r\\nconstexpr float EXTRA_EXERCISE = 10.0f;\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nUPD:\\r\\nActivity levels are quantized by 5 minutes it seems.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe thing is, fighting usually doesn\'t take 5 full minutes, but it\'s still considered EXTRA_EXERCISE, which leads to a much higher calorie cost of melee than should be, making it a prohibitively expensive specialization. In fact, character efficiency doesn\'t even matter. The character may effortlessly slice through zombies or take forever to stab one to death, from the perspective of the game they both consumed the same amount of energy.\\r\\n\\r\\nSo, if you try to kill even a single zombie (or even just punch them casually) within a 5 minute window, you can say goodbye to your roughly 60 calories. So while a 5 minute time quanta may make some sense for walking, for fighting it is ridiculously wide.","closed_at":"2020-08-21T05:28:28Z","comments":"12","comments_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA\\/issues\\/43065\\/comments","created_at":"2020-08-20T11:31:43Z","events_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA\\/issues\\/43065\\/events","html_url":"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA\\/issues\\/43065","id":"682641116","labels":[{"color":"cccccc","default":false,"description":"Bug that is duplicate of another one","id":"14965559","name":"(S3 - Duplicate)","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDk2NTU1OQ==","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA\\/labels\\/(S3%20-%20Duplicate)"}],"labels_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA\\/issues\\/43065\\/labels{\\/name}","locked":false,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2ODI2NDExMTY=","number":"43065","repository_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA","state":"closed","title":"Modifiers of basal metabolic rate for various activity levels are set way too high and are unreasonable for the activity\'s expected calorie consumption, aggravated by a calorie counter window of 5 minutes","updated_at":"2021-01-02T16:37:54Z","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/CleverRaven\\/Cataclysm-DDA\\/issues\\/43065","user":{"avatar_url