{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/40058171?","display_login":"SonalSingh18","gravatar_id":"","id":"40058171","login":"SonalSingh18","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/SonalSingh18"},"created_at":"2021-01-02T16:38:53Z","id":"14690752064","org":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/58140211?","gravatar_id":"","id":"58140211","login":"TitaniumOS","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/orgs\\/TitaniumOS"},"payload":{"before":"0face9cab3d866f9fb09263f52a1aa61e74801cc","commits":[{"author":{"email":"088e16a1019277b15d58faf0541e11910eb756f6@lineageos.org","name":"Simon Shields"},"distinct":true,"message":"Add LineageButtons (volume skip track hooks)\\n\\n--\\nabcu: move to main framework\\n--\\n\\nThis class will be the new home for all the buttons logic currently\\nin fw\\/b. Currently, it only implements the \\"long press volume keys to\\nskip\\" feature.\\n\\nBased on the following commits from cm-14.1:\\n\\ncommit 1296fb316946ca1361b2d32557b6c9e028f509c8\\nAuthor: Dark Eyes <dark_eyes_@hotmail.com>\\nDate:   Sat Nov 5 12:09:31 2016 -0400\\n\\n    Fix long press volume buttons skip tracks\\n\\n    Without that patch, the volume changes up or down prior\\n    to skipping tracks because the sendvolumekeyevent doesn\'t\\n    have the mayChangeVolume condition. Also, that part is\\n    useless cause the mUseTvRouting condition is taken care\\n    of correctly later.\\n\\n    Change-Id: I88757315f135f013e7692861d46b3a07fbfc07d5\\n\\ncommit 61cebe2fea95f799b7b4edc540f6c38d3c13fbde\\nAuthor: Michael Bestas <mikeioannina@gmail.com>\\nDate:   Thu Dec 18 14:43:22 2014 +0200\\n\\n    Fix volume key music controls and wake up\\n\\n    - Forward port code from cm-11.0 and adjust for 5.0\\n    - Fix not being able to adjust volume when music control is on\\n    - Disable screen off volume\\/music control when wake key is enabled\\n\\n    Change-Id: Ie0ad83965c41fd33120490c25a4ff3d9b2cbeb37\\n\\ncommit f41ba8af1796b4903dba3d134e56e8148f3b4808\\nAuthor: Austin T. Conn <atc3030dev@gmail.com>\\nDate:   Wed Dec 17 13:28:00 2014 -0500\\n\\n    Settings: Forward Port Volume Long Press Skip Tracks (1\\/2)\\n\\n    Bring Forward Volume Rocker Track Change\\n\\n    Requires Settings Change\\n    http:\\/\\/review.cyanogenmod.org\\/#\\/c\\/82222\\/\\n\\n    Change-Id: I70b00e08fe48707110725dd1daa56b1e48d15a03\\n\\nChange-Id: I5c7f733913242bba822cf3f9f7e1e3320c2bedf7\\n\\nPhoneWindowManager: add LineageButtons volumekey hook\\n\\nWe can\'t use a generic DeviceKeyHandler here, because we don\'t want to\\noverride some of the AOSP logic (silencing incoming calls, screenshots)\\nand we need to know if the device is interactive or not (for screen-off\\nmusic controls)\\n\\nChange-Id: I485c2f6006c5bbd358ba0cbd32917689826c5c6d\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"5ca14dc2a7ca27119a4954962178eba062a73365","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/5ca14dc2a7ca27119a4954962178eba062a73365"},{"author":{"email":"a10983cefa4765ea0a7b00b4a3b337b242d83516@gmail.com","name":"ezio84"},"distinct":true,"message":"Fix volume rocker skip track on Ambient Display and Lift to Wake\\n\\nwe need to check if dream service is dozing before checking\\nkeyguard status\\n\\nChange-Id: Ic3a6c830496188bb6edf27043cd24eb2d553bb82\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"addcfdc90798f4dcf0e43c0a7f5614416e8b1c9e","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/addcfdc90798f4dcf0e43c0a7f5614416e8b1c9e"},{"author":{"email":"a10983cefa4765ea0a7b00b4a3b337b242d83516@gmail.com","name":"ezio84"},"distinct":true,"message":"ScreenOFF volume skiptrack (with remote Spotify support)\\n\\nand other players that allow music controls for remote devices (PC, PS4)\\nthrough the media notification\\n\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"cbb7892dcc99aa3061e10dd46f1d7282bad9d771","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/cbb7892dcc99aa3061e10dd46f1d7282bad9d771"},{"author":{"email":"a10983cefa4765ea0a7b00b4a3b337b242d83516@gmail.com","name":"ezio84"},"distinct":true,"message":"Ambient music: pulse on new music tracks and Now Playing info [1\\/2]\\n\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"380d2f0a209820512fc510540b0db0ff9222d4c2","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/380d2f0a209820512fc510540b0db0ff9222d4c2"},{"author":{"email":"a10983cefa4765ea0a7b00b4a3b337b242d83516@gmail.com","name":"ezio84"},"distinct":true,"message":"Ambient music ticker: double tap on track title to skip track\\n\\nTODO: KeyguardSliceProvider ListBuilder api allows to set an\\naction (SliceAction) to the slices, that triggers a provided pendingintent.\\nSo we could add it then get the action in KeyguardSliceView with header.getPrimaryAction\\nand record it in mClickActions to load and trigger it later in the\\nonClick\\n\\n----\\n\\nAmbient music ticker AoD: make it compatibile with double tap sensor\\n\\nalso don\'t wake up on skip track events when pulsing Ambient\\n\\nTLDR: some devices like the Pixel2xl have a specific double tap sensor for AoD\\nthat handles the touches in this screen state and nothing is dispatched\\nto StatusBarWindowView, and it\'s enabled by the double tap to wake\\noption available in Settings - System - Gestures.\\n\\nWe can use the related onDoubleTap callback that Google already added\\non purpose to manage double taps  on the AmbientContainer (Now Playing on\\nAndroid P) when AoD is showing, to trigger the skip track event we need.\\n\\n------\\n\\nDisable ticker DT2SkipTrack and wake to Ambient on Soli devices\\n\\nSoli has its own implementation for both things\\n\\nChange-Id: Idb5bab48718c8668bc3868e34ac0e844a06d77ef\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"6670b1db323786d2710333d7b87a65ae10abb1e1","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/6670b1db323786d2710333d7b87a65ae10abb1e1"},{"author":{"email":"a10983cefa4765ea0a7b00b4a3b337b242d83516@gmail.com","name":"ezio84"},"distinct":true,"message":"fixup! Show Ambient instead of lockscreen on wake gestures [1\\/2]\\n\\n* Stallix edit: Add mDeviceHasSoli check.","sha":"b835efdc45684d3ee260c09d438e9d775c3bbec0","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/b835efdc45684d3ee260c09d438e9d775c3bbec0"},{"author":{"email":"b2abd4fd7a88af9e2060dd190b9a75981518104c@gmail.com","name":"maxwen"},"distinct":true,"message":"base: SystemUI: enable tuner and show in Evolver\\n\\nChange-Id: I4d3ff3ca989e6a6952419d147208318ee269b9d7\\nSigned-off-by: xyyx <xyyx@mail.ru>\\nSigned-off-by: mracar07 <umutcan@umutcanacar.me>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"f4c732d43502069052a5d2f3b3865f72c68fd94c","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/f4c732d43502069052a5d2f3b3865f72c68fd94c"},{"author":{"email":"0bb6b04afdf3f0678200de9e922c93cd5ca45bb6@mail.ru","name":"xyyx"},"distinct":true,"message":"Tuner: Hide icon in QS\\n\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"d7992d31b00393f8a0b92b80a9812071430aabaa","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/d7992d31b00393f8a0b92b80a9812071430aabaa"},{"author":{"email":"34a7a5ec17579361e2b1ffa5b629a77855aabfbf@gmail.com","name":"ElDainosor"},"distinct":true,"message":"Add Lockscreen album art filter [1\\/2]\\n\\nneobuddy89: Improvised and adapted for Android 10 and Android 11.\\n\\nspezi77: Adapted for SettingsObserver\\n\\nSigned-off-by: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"24cc073e762432ffe20a1bf9ac04e0ac49fb839a","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/24cc073e762432ffe20a1bf9ac04e0ac49fb839a"},{"author":{"email":"711c73f64afdce07b7e38039a96d2224209e9a6c@cypheros.co","name":"Chris Crump"},"distinct":true,"message":"SystemUI: Animate the keyguard when charging\\n\\n* Displays a subtle bolt animation when the device is plugged into a charger.\\n* This only displays on the keyguard when plugged or coming from an interactive state.\\n* Does not display in doze mode since we have a indicator there already.\\n\\nSigned-off-by: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"19de7efcbd51bd343a83bba9664c677b8b87514d","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/19de7efcbd51bd343a83bba9664c677b8b87514d"},{"author":{"email":"d688953a19dcb476c5fb90e6abba87f77b09be65@gmail.com","name":"Pranav Vashi"},"distinct":true,"message":"Add toggle for charging animation [1\\/2]\\n\\nspezi77: Adapted for SettingsObserver\\n\\nSigned-off-by: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"9266d1f63b914e0eebe6190f5dbd1f9c276b59f9","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/9266d1f63b914e0eebe6190f5dbd1f9c276b59f9"},{"author":{"email":"84b269630019c7a737770fd2a808486dbbcdc6c7@yahoo.com","name":"SuperDroidBond"},"distinct":true,"message":"SystemUI: KG Charging Animation: Add more animations [1\\/3]\\n\\nSpecial Thanks to Rodolphe06, Flowdor Theme Dev for the json files\\n\\nneobuddy89: Smarter coding. :)\\n\\nspezi77: Adapted for SettingsObserver\\n\\nSigned-off-by: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"f155ebf140ef7659c652214420c25614114fd964","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/f155ebf140ef7659c652214420c25614114fd964"},{"author":{"email":"d1ebe00ca6a9a017f487af738344aaa6c3609f8c@gmail.com","name":"Hikari-no-Tenshi"},"distinct":true,"message":"SystemUI: Move charging animation above FOD icon if In-display fingerprint is active\\n\\n* Stallix edit: Use our FodUtils config checking.\\n\\nSome code is taken from commit:\\n\\nFrom: Chris Crump <chris@cypheros.co>\\nDate: Wed, 3 Jul 2019 20:05:01 -0400\\nSubject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Don\'t show charging animation if In-display fingerprint is active\\n\\nIt obstructs the in-display fingerprint view\\n\\nChange-Id: I4a12a8d0aa746800d22a4e7652793a7be96c9d81\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"aeac6b3e22679d8ce1d6ff761898c9924b17545a","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/aeac6b3e22679d8ce1d6ff761898c9924b17545a"},{"author":{"email":"b13b4650c9903460d5af018ab287342f2ed1b3ff@gmail.com","name":"AnkitGourav"},"distinct":true,"message":"SystemUI: Show keyguard charging animation on AOD\\n\\nSigned-off-by: AnkitGourav <Ankitgourav035@gmail.com>\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"543b4f14669b5cece59f8f81940300afc95eb4e6","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/543b4f14669b5cece59f8f81940300afc95eb4e6"},{"author":{"email":"16a9a54ddf4259952e3c118c763138e83693d7fd@frap129.org","name":"Joe Maples"},"distinct":true,"message":"fixup! core: Materialize Toast notifications","sha":"8d67ebc398c436314b383e7ab4ab7f0d39c24340","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/8d67ebc398c436314b383e7ab4ab7f0d39c24340"},{"author":{"email":"0102195f55069eb1dca3c3b9bf49817b1dd6ccb9@gmail.com","name":"DennySPB"},"distinct":true,"message":"Restore AOSP toast theme\\n\\nSigned-off-by: DennySPB <dennyspb@gmail.com>\\nChange-Id: I01a549cb8ec0579bd84f45c715b40f9e0afd3739\\nSigned-off-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"508058b5dcbeb45d4f816cdc5dc9b1a708a391bc","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/508058b5dcbeb45d4f816cdc5dc9b1a708a391bc"},{"author":{"email":"df4bf92e16bbb7396c50d637f6b7ad9a4c8c274c@kdrag0n.dev","name":"Danny Lin"},"distinct":true,"message":"core: Expose method to start assistant through Binder\\n\\nThis is necessary in order to start the default assistant app from other\\nsystem apps using platform APIs, which we need for implementing gestures\\nin a modular way.\\n\\nChange-Id: Ic04d742acff07ce8b5b88a4296d01b1fe1036d9e\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"171748b233d5c66faa4fc4bd54fc707c69eca1e3","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/171748b233d5c66faa4fc4bd54fc707c69eca1e3"},{"author":{"email":"df4bf92e16bbb7396c50d637f6b7ad9a4c8c274c@kdrag0n.dev","name":"Danny Lin"},"distinct":true,"message":"SystemUI: Allow privileged system apps to access screenshot service\\n\\nThis is necessary in order to take a screenshot from other apps using\\nplatform APIs as if the user used the screenshot keychord, which we need\\nfor implementing gestures in a modular way. The service is still\\nprotected by the INTERACT_ACROSS_USERS_FULL permission, which is already\\nnecessary to get far enough to attempt binding to this service.\\n\\nNote that existing screenshot APIs are not sufficient because they only\\nallow apps to get an image of the screen; we want the full user\\nexperience of the animations, actions, preview, sound, etc. that\\nnormally come with a user-initiated screenshot.\\n\\nChange-Id: Ieb559d5dc921393f68aa1d6142f7834d89d4e22b\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"c377b35067c564271b3dac22fd322ccd1fa5d8cc","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/c377b35067c564271b3dac22fd322ccd1fa5d8cc"},{"author":{"email":"df4bf92e16bbb7396c50d637f6b7ad9a4c8c274c@kdrag0n.dev","name":"Danny Lin"},"distinct":true,"message":"SystemUI: Convert global actions to translucent overlay with blur\\n\\nWhen blur is enabled, the glass blur scrim creates a nice visual effect\\nbehind the global actions overlay that makes it look better integrated\\nthan the default gray-on-black global actions view. The standard dark\\nnotification shade scrim will be used if blur is disabled.\\n\\nChange-Id: Icdaae8555cd76deaf476c1621d0ab1f0c00707db\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"9a90ef076c74a44a81da89c910b9cb889bdbf912","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/9a90ef076c74a44a81da89c910b9cb889bdbf912"},{"author":{"email":"df4bf92e16bbb7396c50d637f6b7ad9a4c8c274c@kdrag0n.dev","name":"Danny Lin"},"distinct":true,"message":"graphics: Adjust ripple animation for immediate feedback\\n\\nLack of immediate feedback when interacting with UI elements that use\\nripple animations makes the phone feel much slower and more clunky than\\nit really is. Immediate touch feedback is part of why iOS feels more\\nresponsive in many areas.\\n\\nThere is now a 225 ms hold time and 225 ms fading exit time to remain\\ntiming-compatible with the original Material ripple, since many\\nother animations are time-synced to it.\\n\\nChange-Id: I6585cced2b3f0a6dbf89a4dd8ff6a3326321a166\\nSigned-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\\nSigned-off-by: Joey Huab <joey@evolution-x.org>","sha":"d16429e097f7ae9f090a08ff02ca7dc8725b23ea","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base\\/commits\\/d16429e097f7ae9f090a08ff02ca7dc8725b23ea"}],"distinct_size":"33","head":"23b7b2c896a365f4d67cd74f5070dc23edfe52e4","push_id":"6285849581","ref":"refs\\/heads\\/eleven","size":"33"},"public":true,"repo":{"id":"223754460","name":"TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/TitaniumOS\\/frameworks_base"},"type":"PushEvent"}
