{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/2970164?","display_login":"chhsiao1981","gravatar_id":"","id":"2970164","login":"chhsiao1981","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981"},"created_at":"2021-01-02T16:40:17Z","id":"14690757438","org":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/71451360?","gravatar_id":"","id":"71451360","login":"Ptt-official-app","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/orgs\\/Ptt-official-app"},"payload":{"action":"created","comment":{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"One caveat is that talk is using kill USR1 \\/ USR2.\\r\\nThe users on c-pttbbs will not be able to send message to go-pttbbs.\\r\\n(It\'s possible that it\'s ok in reality～)\\r\\n\\r\\nThe main purpose of this setup is to keep user-count up-to-date.\\r\\n(from c-pttbbs\\/util\\/shmctl utmpsortd)\\r\\n\\r\\nAn alternative setup is just skipping updating shm.userinfo.\\r\\nLet the users in go-pttbbs treated as hidden-user in c-pttbbs.\\r\\n","created_at":"2021-01-02T16:40:17Z","html_url":"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs\\/issues\\/66#issuecomment-753495844","id":"753495844","issue_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs\\/issues\\/66","node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc1MzQ5NTg0NA==","updated_at":"2021-01-02T16:40:17Z","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs\\/issues\\/comments\\/753495844","user":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars0.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/2970164?v=4","events_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/events{\\/privacy}","followers_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/followers","following_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/following{\\/other_user}","gists_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/gists{\\/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/chhsiao1981","id":"2970164","login":"chhsiao1981","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzAxNjQ=","organizations_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/orgs","received_events_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/received_events","repos_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/starred{\\/owner}{\\/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981"}},"issue":{"assignees":[],"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\\r\\nA clear and concise description of what the problem is. Ex. I\'m always frustrated when [...]\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps:\\/\\/github.com\\/ptt\\/pttbbs\\/blob\\/master\\/mbbsd\\/mbbsd.c#L953\\r\\n(mbbsd.setup_utmp)\\r\\n\\r\\nthis is right-after user login \\/ register,\\r\\nto help all kinds of online-user list.\\r\\n\\r\\nHowever, there will be only 1 pid in go-pttbbs (go-pttbbs is multi-thread)\\r\\n\\r\\n**Describe the solution you\'d like**\\r\\nA clear and concise description of what you want to happen.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe would assume that there will be only 1 login per user in go-pttbbs.\\r\\n(If there are multiple-logins, it\'s still 1 login from go-pttbbs\'s view. It will be middlewares\' responsibility to take care of multiple-logins)\\r\\n\\r\\nI would like to propose that the pid of the user in go-pttbbs will be PID_MAX + uid (usernum in pttbbs, starting from 1)\\r\\nas the pseudo-pid.\\r\\n\\r\\npid-max is defined in kernel.pid_max (sysctl -a)\\r\\n\\r\\nchecked that kill(2) treats pid < 0 as pid-group., and pid == -1 as all processes except system-processes.\\r\\npid < 0 may not be a good.\\r\\n\\r\\nThere will be the following modifications in setup_utmp and cache.getnewutmpent in go-pttbbs side:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. setup_utmp: calculate pid based on uid.\\r\\n2. getnewutmpent: check whether the original utmp exists or not, return original utmp if already exists. otherwise, set new utmp.\\r\\n    (caveat: how to deal with race-condition with auto-logout？～)\\r\\n\\r\\n**Describe alternatives you\'ve considered**\\r\\nA clear and concise description of any alternative solutions or features you\'ve considered.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Additional context**\\r\\nAdd any other context or screenshots about the feature request here.\\r\\n","comments":"0","comments_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs\\/issues\\/66\\/comments","created_at":"2021-01-02T15:52:39Z","events_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs\\/issues\\/66\\/events","html_url":"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs\\/issues\\/66","id":"777481045","labels":[{"color":"244EA6","default":false,"description":"","id":"2626563127","name":"discussion","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjI2NTYzMTI3","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs\\/labels\\/discussion"}],"labels_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs\\/issues\\/66\\/labels{\\/name}","locked":false,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU3Nzc0ODEwNDU=","number":"66","repository_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs","state":"open","title":"utmp in shm.userinfo.","updated_at":"2021-01-02T16:40:17Z","url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/repos\\/Ptt-official-app\\/go-pttbbs\\/issues\\/66","user":{"avatar_url":"https:\\/\\/avatars0.githubusercontent.com\\/u\\/2970164?v=4","events_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/events{\\/privacy}","followers_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/followers","following_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/following{\\/other_user}","gists_url":"https:\\/\\/api.github.com\\/users\\/chhsiao1981\\/gists{\\/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/chhsiao1981","id":"2970164","login":"chhsiao1981","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzAxN